# lamps_clock_rpg_dust.phases.pdl - rpg-dust: clock restored by load + shared lamps (2026-11-04), scratch house only. Header (GAME/NEEDS) copied from rpg_dust_planet_map.phases.pdl.
# rpg_dust_planet_map.phases.pdl - asteroids and another ship ON THE PLANET MAP, the same space as the ship and Cata Prime (owner 2026-10-26: "i expected to see them on same map as planet/ship cata prime"). BOOK 16.game/RPG-SPACE-COLLISION-AND-DESTRUCTION-DESIGN.md 7i.
# Runner: ops/+x/playthrough_op.+x run play/phases/rpg_dust_planet_map.phases.pdl (a scratch house under /tmp; nothing live is touched).
# Geometry the expected values come from: the hull covers desk cells 2..13 of the 16 x 16 desk; a desk cell = world cell minus the flight shift (state/direct.txt); the beam reaches obj_reach=2 cells from the hull rectangle; the hull may not sit on an object while the ship flies at or below obj_top=6.
GAME | rpg-dust | rpg_dust
EVENTS | yes
NEEDS | &.widgits/world-ops/ops/+x/wo.+x
# the rpg-dust skin text-includes the shared petslike core and its helpers (the scratch house has only what is listed)
NEEDS | &.widgits/_shared-lib/petslike_core.c
NEEDS | &.widgits/_shared-lib/petslike_toolbar.c
NEEDS | &.widgits/_shared-lib/pet_sky.c
NEEDS | &.widgits/_shared-lib/pet_footer.c
NEEDS | &.widgits/_shared-lib/pet_nudge.c
NEEDS | &.widgits/_shared-lib/kh_state_notify.h
NEEDS | &.widgits/_shared-lib/csv_frames.c
NEEDS | &.widgits/_shared-lib/petslike_skin_lib.c
NEEDS | &.widgits/_shared-lib/petslike_autotile.c
NEEDS | &.widgits/_shared-lib/petslike_life.c
NEEDS | @.apps/rpg-dust/ops/+x/dust_gen.+x
NEEDS | @.apps/rpg-dust/ops/+x/dust_seed.+x
NEEDS | @.apps/rpg-dust/ops/+x/dust_zoom.+x
NEEDS | @.apps/rpg-dust/ops/+x/dust_orbit.+x
NEEDS | @.apps/rpg-dust/ops/+x/dust_check.+x
# the planet pages are painted from RPG Maker sheets (the assets live above the house)
NEEDS | ../../../#.NNEST_ASSETS/rmmv-www-img/tilesets/Outside_A5.png | #.NNEST_ASSETS/rmmv-www-img/tilesets/Outside_A5.png
NEEDS | ../../../#.NNEST_ASSETS/rmmv-www-img/tilesets/Outside_B.png | #.NNEST_ASSETS/rmmv-www-img/tilesets/Outside_B.png
CFLAGS | -I$T/@.apps/rpg-dust/ops
INIT | rpg-dust-pchq/pieces/system/maps/.keep | scratch board pieces folder\n

# the gate's own seed rows (the geometry every pin below is worked out from): the real space.pdl puts the objects far out on the 48 x 48 land, this one keeps them against the hull
INIT | space.pdl | ROCK  \p rock_1 \p 2 \p 2 \p ore     \p 6 \p Rusty Rock\nROCK  \p rock_2 \p 1 \p 3 \p rock    \p 8 \p Grey Chunk\nROCK  \p rock_3 \p 3 \p 1 \p crystal \p 3 \p Glint\nCRAFT \p skiff_1 \p 2 \p 4 \p Wren (skiff) \p pip:12:0:0,nova:12:1:0 \p iron:2,bread:3\nWROCK  \p wr_1 \p cata \p 15 \p 5  \p ore     \p 5\nWROCK  \p wr_2 \p cata \p 3  \p 14 \p rock    \p 7\nWROCK  \p wr_3 \p cata \p 0  \p 9  \p crystal \p 3\nWCRAFT \p skiff_1 \p cata \p 14 \p 1 \p Wren\n


PHASE | p1_clock_load | save, move the clock on, load: the game clock is back where it was saved | clock, save, load
DO | clock | advance | 2h
MARK | c0 | state/clock_root/#.desktop/clocks/rpg.pdl | game_time_epoch_ms
DO | save | 9
SAY | saved | save-says-saved
DO | clock | advance | 3h
MARK | c1 | state/clock_root/#.desktop/clocks/rpg.pdl | game_time_epoch_ms
DELTA | c0 | c1 | 10800000 | control-the-advance-moved-the-clock-three-hours
DO | load | 9
MARK | c2 | state/clock_root/#.desktop/clocks/rpg.pdl | game_time_epoch_ms
EQ | c0 | c2 | load-restored-the-saved-clock
NE | c1 | c2 | the-clock-really-moved-back-from-the-advanced-value

PHASE | p2_lamps | a bought lamp lights its room while lamps are on, and the lamp rows are gone when they are off | lamps, light, 3d book
DO | buy | lamp
SAY | Lamp pillar | lamp-bought-and-placed
DO | lamps | on
SAY | lamps on | lamps-verb-answers
EXISTS | lamps.pdl | lamps-pdl-is-in-the-scratch-game
HAS | rpg-dust-pchq/pieces/system/maps/rpg-dust/bridge/lights.pdl | 6 \p 1.00 \p 0.85 \p 0.55 \p 0.90 | lamps-on-writes-a-light-row-for-the-lamp
DO | lamps | off
LACKS | rpg-dust-pchq/pieces/system/maps/rpg-dust/bridge/lights.pdl | 6 \p 1.00 \p 0.85 \p 0.55 \p 0.90 | lamps-off-leaves-no-lamp-row
